{"version":1,"key":"card:281","content":{"id":281,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"通过关键字 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"extends","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 即可来继承一个类，继承自其它类的类称为子类，或者派生类。在子类的构造方法 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"constructor","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中，","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"必须首先通过调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":" 方法来调用父类的构造函数","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，它会在这里初始化 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，如果没有调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法的话，会抛出错误，并且 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法只能被调用一次，且必须在访问 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量之前。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"920334bb-6e03-43f7-bd6d-ac71010c212e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"唯一不用在子类中调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法的情况就是在构造函数中返回一个对象。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"676a7c26-b8b4-4a43-bc78-218dd3ce29b9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Person {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this.name = name;\n  }\n\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(\"Hello World\");\n  }\n}\n\nclass Student extends Person{\n  constructor(name) {\n    super(name);\n  }\n}\n\nconst stu = new Student(\"Alice\");\nstu.sayHello(); // Hello World\nconsole.log(stu instanceof Student); // true\nconsole.log(stu instanceof Person);  // true","collabId":"aeaaa7bd-b045-449b-a26c-e044f0f9a19b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5300f02c-2f2e-48e9-8b2e-c2c73cea0526","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"7aad973f-c7ea-465e-9dcb-e63faf1a7ad5"},{"children":[{"text":"可以在子类中重写父类中的方法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b448a91-96d7-426b-b9b9-788a31d06327","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Person {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this.name = name;\n  }\n\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(\"Hello World\");\n  }\n}\n\nclass Student extends Person{\n  constructor(name) {\n    super(name);\n  }\n\n  // 重写父类的方法\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(\"Hi\");\n  }\n}\n\nconst stu = new Student(\"Alice\");\nstu.sayHello(); // Hi","collabId":"482eadea-6aa9-492e-be93-1fce3a643b3a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"67803f2d-cb58-43d3-9bf5-32523edc74fa","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"93c1c60e-37be-4617-9244-250d09fa4984"},{"children":[{"text":"如果我们需要在子类中调用父类中被重写方法，我们可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 调用，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中包含指向父类的方法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1024fb2b-00ae-48de-8987-93bad8abb9af","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Student extends Person{\n  // ...\n  sayHello() {\n    super.sayHello();\n    console.log(\"Hi\");\n  }\n}\n\nconst stu = new Student(\"Alice\");\nstu.sayHello(); // Hello World\n                // Hi","collabId":"8c79c308-289d-4a98-b1bb-b09909523a26","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"7aa2a598-feda-4fd0-8302-5ff4a10d0f09","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b8bf756f-54aa-423a-834b-3fdc56de45b5"},{"children":[{"text":"类中的静态方法也可以被继承","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f15d7c98-2c1c-494f-9b6f-c6db3d5a169b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Person {\n  static print(...value) {\n    console.log(...value);\n  }\n}\n\nclass Student extends Person {}\n\nStudent.print(\"Hello\", \"World\");","collabId":"5760fa70-b47b-415c-80d7-4eab641b67d3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"14c8002e-4482-4552-af9e-d1a44c7751d9","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c0e538ea-ea75-4cc0-b133-c3d0ad19f5e8"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"extends","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 后面不仅仅可以是类，还可以是一个函数，只要函数有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Constructor]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法即可，也可以是一个表达式，只要表达式的结果是具有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Constructor]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法的函数即可","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"72bd3cf2-bd7a-41df-a489-231ca7edda42","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n}\n\nPerson.print = console.log;\n\n// 继承自一个函数\nclass Student extends Person {}\n\nStudent.print(\"Hello\", \"World\"); // Hello World","collabId":"1c72852e-08b3-47c5-ab8c-f2620f3316a3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e504b7a8-c651-4b54-b610-5971c5e4ab52","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"ac079093-2856-46f1-ba15-378766cfc79a"},{"children":[{"text":"因为","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"箭头函数","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3ea63916-f5e2-48a0-b9f6-c8a3021f9779","contentId":231,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":240,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"没有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[[Constructor]]","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，所以箭头函数是不可以被继承的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"54417cdd-dbd6-4306-849d-fe1ce763a88f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["JavaScript/类"],"createTime":1692112255929,"updateTime":1793532522125,"linkedCards":[{"id":275,"target":{"key":"card:275","type":"card","id":275},"summary":"如果重写了原型中的方法，如何访问原型中的方法。 在 ES5 中，通过 Object.getPrototypeOf(this).[method].call(this) 来访问原型 const person = { sayHello() { r...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":276,"target":{"key":"card:276","type":"card","id":276},"summary":"JavaScript 不同于 Java、C++ 等典型的面向对象语言，JavaScript 在过去并没有类的概念，所以一些从 Java 或 C++ 等其他面向语言转过来的开发者会感到困惑，所以在 ES6 中引入了类的概念。 使用关键字 cl...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":280,"target":{"key":"card:280","type":"card","id":280},"summary":"只可以通过类名访问的方法称为静态方法，在 class 定义的类中，通过在方法名前加 static 关键字表示该方法是静态方法 class Person { constructor(name) { this.name = name; } st...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532522125},"links":{"card:240":{"key":"card:240","type":"card","id":240}}}